  - “Key levers: reduce churn by X% points, increase ARPU by upsell/packaging, reduce CAC by improving channels or conversion rates.”
  - “Action items: provide last 4 quarters of S&M spend and new customer counts, churn by cohort, and gross margin by product line for a full cohort LTV model.”

7) Next steps I can do right away
