1) Definitions and formulas
- CAC (Customer Acquisition Cost) = (Total Sales + Marketing spend in a period) / (Number of new customers acquired in same period)
- ARPU (Average Revenue Per User) = (Revenue in period) / (Number of active customers in same period) — can be monthly or annual
- Gross margin (contribution margin) = 1 − COGS% (use contribution margin after direct costs, before S&M and G&A)
