- Use gross-margin-adjusted LTV (don’t use revenue-only LTV).
- If churn is small and retention high, use discounted LTV if you want to be conservative (LTV = sum of discounted future contribution).
- Show payback sensitivity (3–6–12 months) for investor comfort.

