- If you have mixed cohorts (enterprise vs mid-market vs SMB), break out CAC and LTV by cohort — high-level consolidated metrics can hide risk.
- Highlight payback: If payback <12 months, you can safely invest to grow; if >12–18 months, growth investment should be disciplined.
- Reinforce that gross margin improvements and churn reductions are the most efficient levers to grow LTV and improve payback.

