Key formulas
- CAC = Total Sales & Marketing Spend / # New Customers acquired (same period)
- ARPA (monthly) = Monthly Revenue / # Active Accounts
- LTV (simple, recurring revenue SaaS) = (ARPA * Gross Margin) / Monthly Churn Rate
  - Equivalent: LTV = ARPA * Gross Margin * Average Customer Lifetime (1 / churn)
- LTV : CAC ratio = LTV / CAC
